1
00:00:48,359 --> 00:00:49,159
Report!

2
00:00:49,159 --> 00:00:50,439
We've found the Dragon-Seeking Descendant.

3
00:00:56,280 --> 00:00:57,359
Who are you?

4
00:00:57,719 --> 00:00:59,479
I'm a descendant of the Dragon-Seeking Lineage.

5
00:00:59,759 --> 00:01:03,479
I'll use the Dragon-Seeking Formula to help the Chief find the Tidal Tomb.

6
00:01:03,880 --> 00:01:04,879
I also...

7
00:01:06,680 --> 00:01:07,959
What was the next line again?

8
00:01:09,640 --> 00:01:10,719
Where did you find this trash?

9
00:01:10,719 --> 00:01:11,560
Calm down, Young Master.

10
00:01:11,560 --> 00:01:12,599
Time is running out,

11
00:01:12,680 --> 00:01:14,599
so we could only find someone around the same age.

12
00:01:14,599 --> 00:01:15,400
You...

13
00:01:19,359 --> 00:01:20,159
Forget it.

14
00:01:20,200 --> 00:01:21,040
He'll have to do.

15
00:01:21,680 --> 00:01:25,280
Let him shut the Wan and Mei families up first,

16
00:01:25,560 --> 00:01:27,359
and help me become the Chief of the four families.

17
00:01:28,560 --> 00:01:30,480
As for the real Dragon-Seeking Descendant...

18
00:01:30,480 --> 00:01:31,680
Four days.

19
00:01:31,680 --> 00:01:33,719
Find him within four days, no matter what.

20
00:01:33,719 --> 00:01:34,400
Yes, sir.

21
00:01:39,640 --> 00:01:40,439
Come back.

22
00:01:42,280 --> 00:01:44,719
Memorize your lines properly.

23
00:01:45,680 --> 00:01:46,480
You got it!

24
00:02:34,560 --> 00:02:35,919
Li Xiao thinks he's so clever.

25
00:02:35,919 --> 00:02:37,439
He only blew up the obvious path.

26
00:02:37,560 --> 00:02:40,520
The real way out needs the right person to reveal it.

27
00:02:42,800 --> 00:02:43,759
Where is he?

28
00:02:45,639 --> 00:02:47,199
Wait for me!

29
00:02:50,240 --> 00:02:51,639
It's a dead end.

30
00:02:54,599 --> 00:02:55,800
What do we do?

31
00:03:02,400 --> 00:03:04,000
Get back!

32
00:03:04,000 --> 00:03:04,800
Hurry!

33
00:03:17,439 --> 00:03:18,240
Here they come.

34
00:03:33,319 --> 00:03:34,400
Zhang Tianyou.

35
00:03:34,400 --> 00:03:35,319
Miss me?

36
00:03:45,240 --> 00:03:47,599
You're the descendant of the
Zhang family's Dragon-Seeking Lineage?

37
00:03:48,159 --> 00:03:48,840
That's right.

38
00:03:48,840 --> 00:03:50,000
That would be me.

39
00:03:50,280 --> 00:03:51,879
I will certainly assist the Chief

40
00:03:51,879 --> 00:03:53,960
to find the Tidal Tomb from twenty years ago,

41
00:03:53,960 --> 00:03:56,719
and help the Four Great Families
crack the tomb and quell the evil.

42
00:03:57,560 --> 00:03:59,159
Then tell us how to find it.

43
00:03:59,639 --> 00:04:01,280
Rumor has it that the tomb can move.

44
00:04:03,319 --> 00:04:06,879
My Dragon-Seeking Lineage has a secret method,

45
00:04:06,879 --> 00:04:08,199
the Dragon-Seeking Formula.

46
00:04:09,479 --> 00:04:13,520
It reads the moving stars above
and the hidden earth veins below.

47
00:04:14,360 --> 00:04:17,600
No matter how the Tidal Tomb drifts with the Dragon Qi,

48
00:04:18,560 --> 00:04:20,199
it cannot escape my eyes.

49
00:04:21,759 --> 00:04:22,759
Excellent.

50
00:04:23,360 --> 00:04:25,040
Brother Wan, look.

51
00:04:25,279 --> 00:04:26,680
This is destiny.

52
00:04:27,360 --> 00:04:29,279
With the help of the Dragon-Seeking Descendant,

53
00:04:29,439 --> 00:04:32,079
our grand plan is sure to succeed!

54
00:04:32,240 --> 00:04:33,120
Great.

55
00:04:34,319 --> 00:04:35,519
Since that's the case,

56
00:04:35,720 --> 00:04:37,240
once Chun'er wakes up,

57
00:04:37,480 --> 00:04:39,120
we will arrange your wedding immediately.

58
00:04:39,959 --> 00:04:41,160
Brother Wan,

59
00:04:41,399 --> 00:04:42,759
we must focus on the big picture.

60
00:04:43,000 --> 00:04:47,040
How can a wedding compare to our grand plan?

61
00:04:47,480 --> 00:04:48,519
The most urgent matter

62
00:04:48,560 --> 00:04:50,079
is for this descendant

63
00:04:50,079 --> 00:04:53,120
to deduce the Tidal Tomb's location at once.

64
00:04:53,319 --> 00:04:56,240
And electing a Chief to take charge

65
00:04:56,240 --> 00:04:58,839
is a matter of utmost urgency, Brother.

66
00:04:59,839 --> 00:05:02,399
Then I'll leave it to you two.

67
00:05:02,600 --> 00:05:03,680
Brother Wan,

68
00:05:03,680 --> 00:05:04,800
I'll get to it right away.

69
00:05:20,160 --> 00:05:21,079
Uncle Mei,

70
00:05:22,000 --> 00:05:24,519
why won't you meet this Dragon-Seeking Descendant yourself?

71
00:05:25,279 --> 00:05:26,399
Fenglin...

72
00:05:27,120 --> 00:05:29,959
Some people are born to be sacrifices.

73
00:05:30,600 --> 00:05:32,480
A man destined to die...

74
00:05:32,600 --> 00:05:33,839
What's there to see?

75
00:05:35,399 --> 00:05:36,360
Fenglin,

76
00:05:37,399 --> 00:05:39,399
it seems before your father passed,

77
00:05:39,480 --> 00:05:41,839
he really didn't tell you everything.

78
00:05:42,120 --> 00:05:43,959
About that mess from twenty years ago,

79
00:05:43,959 --> 00:05:47,600
it's far more complicated than you think.

80
00:05:48,279 --> 00:05:50,959
Once we find that damn tomb again,

81
00:05:51,199 --> 00:05:53,480
I'll tell you the whole truth.

82
00:05:53,600 --> 00:05:56,079
But before that,

83
00:05:56,199 --> 00:05:59,759
once that kid locates the Tidal Tomb,

84
00:06:00,240 --> 00:06:03,839
stage an accident and make him disappear.

85
00:06:04,439 --> 00:06:05,639
Make it clean.

86
00:06:07,720 --> 00:06:08,759
Uncle Mei,

87
00:06:09,199 --> 00:06:10,600
he's the Dragon-Seeking Descendant.

88
00:06:10,839 --> 00:06:12,360
He's our key to cracking the tomb.

89
00:06:14,920 --> 00:06:16,079
The key?

90
00:06:17,680 --> 00:06:19,480
Fenglin,

91
00:06:19,480 --> 00:06:21,959
when you see through an act,

92
00:06:22,240 --> 00:06:23,680
there's no need to expose it.

93
00:06:23,759 --> 00:06:25,600
We just need to see how things play out,

94
00:06:25,879 --> 00:06:29,000
and take the right opportunity to...

95
00:06:29,000 --> 00:06:30,240
clear the board.

96
00:06:45,160 --> 00:06:45,959
Young Master.

97
00:06:46,120 --> 00:06:48,360
Good thing Chief Leng was out there backing us up.

98
00:06:48,560 --> 00:06:49,680
Otherwise, we'd both be

99
00:06:49,680 --> 00:06:51,160
biting the dust right now.

100
00:06:56,079 --> 00:06:57,000
How come you get a chicken leg?

101
00:06:57,000 --> 00:06:58,079
And I don't?

102
00:06:59,000 --> 00:07:01,879
You think this meal and our lives

103
00:07:01,879 --> 00:07:03,079
came for free?

104
00:07:03,680 --> 00:07:04,680
What do you mean?

105
00:07:07,240 --> 00:07:08,319
To put it bluntly,

106
00:07:09,120 --> 00:07:11,959
Chief Leng has been after my body for a long time.

107
00:07:12,560 --> 00:07:15,759
I have to pay for our lives with it.

108
00:07:18,360 --> 00:07:18,680
Well...

109
00:07:18,680 --> 00:07:19,560
then you should eat more.

110
00:07:19,560 --> 00:07:20,000
Or else...

111
00:07:20,000 --> 00:07:20,839
Here, you eat it.

112
00:07:25,279 --> 00:07:25,800
Forget it.

113
00:07:26,519 --> 00:07:27,319
You eat it.

114
00:07:27,879 --> 00:07:29,040
Remember to come save me!

115
00:07:29,519 --> 00:07:30,839
Take care, Young Master!

116
00:07:47,480 --> 00:07:48,720
Close the door.

117
00:07:59,160 --> 00:08:00,040
Chief Leng.

118
00:08:00,319 --> 00:08:02,399
Thanks for saving my life.

119
00:08:02,480 --> 00:08:05,199
I prepared some wine to show my gratitude.

120
00:08:05,360 --> 00:08:06,279
Have a seat.

121
00:08:08,160 --> 00:08:12,240
A jug of wine isn't enough to repay a life debt.

122
00:08:12,639 --> 00:08:14,160
Since you're here,

123
00:08:15,519 --> 00:08:17,319
how do you plan to repay me?

124
00:08:19,000 --> 00:08:20,240
You guessed it.

125
00:08:23,439 --> 00:08:25,199
As for this thank-you gift...

126
00:08:26,920 --> 00:08:28,600
only you are worthy of it.

127
00:08:31,839 --> 00:08:32,639
What is this?

128
00:08:32,639 --> 00:08:36,399
The personal gear of Sikong Zhaixing,
the Lock Saint of the Tang Dynasty.

129
00:08:36,840 --> 00:08:39,039
It took me quite some effort to get my hands on it.

130
00:08:42,320 --> 00:08:44,879
This thing is much more reliable than a man.

131
00:08:47,120 --> 00:08:48,320
Zhang Tianyou, you...

132
00:08:48,720 --> 00:08:49,919
You're quite a piece of work.

133
00:08:51,480 --> 00:08:52,679
But do you think

134
00:08:54,080 --> 00:08:55,519
Me saving you

135
00:08:57,519 --> 00:08:58,600
was just for this?

136
00:09:00,480 --> 00:09:01,360
I...

137
00:09:03,679 --> 00:09:05,200
Of course not.

138
00:09:07,159 --> 00:09:10,240
I, Zhang Tianyou, always repay my debts.

139
00:09:10,399 --> 00:09:11,840
You saved me once,

140
00:09:11,840 --> 00:09:13,240
so I owe you my life.

141
00:09:13,279 --> 00:09:14,159
B-But...

142
00:09:14,240 --> 00:09:15,759
I think my body is too weak.

143
00:09:15,919 --> 00:09:17,759
I'm afraid I won't serve Chief Leng well.

144
00:09:26,399 --> 00:09:27,639
Who wants your body?

145
00:09:29,919 --> 00:09:30,960
Okay.

146
00:09:30,960 --> 00:09:32,879
T-Then...

147
00:09:32,879 --> 00:09:34,080
U-Um...

148
00:09:35,399 --> 00:09:36,480
I'll be going now.

149
00:09:38,519 --> 00:09:39,840
Get some early rest, Chief Leng.

150
00:09:44,480 --> 00:09:46,039
This bastard.

151
00:09:46,559 --> 00:09:49,759
More fun than those idiots thinking with their dicks.

152
00:09:56,360 --> 00:09:57,159
Come in.

153
00:10:00,480 --> 00:10:02,120
Young Master, we have a lead.

154
00:10:02,120 --> 00:10:03,600
Based on intel from the Marshal's Mansion,

155
00:10:03,600 --> 00:10:05,879
that person changed his name over a decade ago.

156
00:10:06,279 --> 00:10:08,440
He's been hiding right under our noses.

157
00:10:10,039 --> 00:10:10,960
Excellent.

158
00:10:12,519 --> 00:10:13,360
Find him.

159
00:10:14,240 --> 00:10:17,879
Dig him out even if you have to turn this place upside down.

160
00:10:18,440 --> 00:10:20,679
Stall those old foxes outside first.

161
00:10:21,600 --> 00:10:23,960
Once I truly secure the position of Chief,

162
00:10:24,120 --> 00:10:26,240
I'll take my time dealing with them.

163
00:10:31,720 --> 00:10:35,240
My father's greatest glory in this life

164
00:10:35,240 --> 00:10:37,039
wasn't becoming the Marshal,

165
00:10:37,200 --> 00:10:39,240
but having me.
